  "question": "What hotel can I find within 60 kilometers in the forward direction toward Turtle Island Park, Lake in the Hills, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.89054 41.906867)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.328177 42.185635)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'hotel'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.89054 41.906867)',4326)::geography, 60000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.89054 41.906867)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
